{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And the servant took, etc., and went.</b> He took permission from his master to go, after he had prepared the camels, and went from before his master." "<b>And all his master's goods were in his hand.</b> And he took with him <b>vessels of silver and vessels of gold and garments</b>, and for this there was no need to take permission, for everything was in his hand to do with as he wished." "<b>And he arose and went.</b> On his way."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:31:19.467861218Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}